! v1.19.0: fills a cell of the capability matrix that no test
! reached.  The Hybrid column had TS+Freq at
! `not run`: B3LYP is the functional class most users actually
! run, and its P-RFO transition-state search path was verified nowhere.
!
! This is a TRIPWIRE, not an oracle: the pinned value was recorded
! from this build.  It proves the path keeps producing what it
! produces today, which is what the empty cell was missing.
! HCN -> HNC isomerization, same geometry as the HF test_v072 pair.
! Writes <stem>_ts.hess, which the IRC test below consumes through
! the runner's `needs` mechanism.
%method B3LYP
%basis sto-3g
%grid 3
%job ts+freq
%charge  0
%mult    1
%hess_method  analytical
%ts_mode 1
%geom_maxiter 80
%geom angstrom
C   -0.55  -0.20   0.00
N    0.55  -0.20   0.00
H    0.00   0.95   0.00
*end
